# api call for creating admin account
###
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/admin/register/ 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"admin",
    "email":"admin@gmail.com",
    "password":"admin@123",
    "phone":8976543221
}

#api call for creating student account
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/student/register/ 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"yadhu",
    "email":"yadhu@gmail.com",
    "password":"yadhu@123",
    "phone":9847657823
}

